{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1519862400, "end_date": 1520467199, "month_true_total": 1394, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:08 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "40641374", "author": {"steamid": "76561198306091479", "personaname": "Drat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/drako_wulf/", "num_games_owned": 406, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 412601, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1777, "playtime_at_review": 54226, "last_played": 1789102019, "avatar": "4d770c85d2e39b3dac5ae96dd7647f400ee3752c"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the most worth while free to play games I've ever encountered. By far one of my all time favorite games. Although it can get a little dull if you play alone. When you have friends with you, even if it's just one, this game is just about endless fun. If you don't like grinding for good items, then this is not the game for you. This game is absolutely centered around farming resourses and in-game currency. Something to bring up it Platinum, an in-game currency that costs real money to obtain. You can easily get to the max (possible) rank in the game without spending a penny, but if you really feel like using that pay-to-win stat, be my guest. \n\nVery addicting gameplay. Very unique and well-made flowing story. Need to stop giving out the Call of Duty nerfs, but DE is trying. Overall, an amazingly well constructed game. I also wish they'd stop getting rid of out of map glitches, but oh well.", "timestamp_created": 1520464748, "timestamp_updated": 1520464748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_t